"""D batch 70: Stuart's cavalry division: Stuart R565, Hampton R567, W. E. Jones R580 with R581-R583 (Jones' brigade, Robertson's command), Lee R426 and Part 3 orders. No reports by Fitz Lee, Chambliss, W. H. F. Lee or Jenkins exist in the OR index; they are covered from Stuart, Hampton and Lee."""
